# Colour Clash: an introductory four-player arena.
#
# Only the top-left quadrant's walls are written here; SYMMETRY ROT4 repeats
# them under quarter turns about the arena centre. Wall coordinates are
# character cells 0..31; START is in superpixels 0..127.

NAME Colour Clash
SYMMETRY ROT4
WALLS K Y
START 13 13 SE

# A bracket sheltering each player's corner.
MOVE 9 5
DRAW 5 5
DRAW 5 9

# A spur reaching in from the middle of each edge.
MOVE 15 1
DRAW 15 5

# A block beside the centre.
MOVE 12 11
DRAW 13 11
